The DLN preprint is now clear on one point: the proof section explicitly says “we prove the main theorem by developing blow-up method along submanifolds” and then carries out a recursive blow-up induction. I’m now checking whether the two-matrix 2005 reduced-rank paper is the same style of explicit desingularization, or whether the DLN paper merely reduces to it.
