 2026-06-19]\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:3:## VERDICT: ROUTE (a) smooth-point assembly — smaller by a large factor. KMS determinantal sub-library AVOIDED.\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:8:  `dim source = dim target + dim fibre` in any form. Orbit-dimension package ABSENT. `ringKrullDim = trdeg` for\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:9:  f.g. domain/field ABSENT (so even the trdeg-additivity route to (b) is blocked). ⟹ route (b) = a from-scratch\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:14:- **Determinantal PRIMENESS (KMS/Lakshmibai–Magyar) NOT needed.** Take `I = vanishingIdeal(Z_M)` directly —\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:15:  prime from `isPrime_vanishingIdeal_orbitSet` (O_M irreducible, LANDED) + `Z_M = Ō_M` (L6). The cotangent/regular\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:16:  chain runs on the reduced ring; never need \"(minors) = vanishingIdeal\".\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:18:  (intrinsic). NOT via minor pderivs (that would re-import determinantal primeness — guard K2: use dμ_M=δ⁰).\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:21:`varietyDim(Z_M) =[L4d] ringKrullDim(AtPrime m_M) =[M3 smooth⟹regular] finrank(cotangent) =[L2a, LANDED]\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:27:- L6.3 easy direction (rank lower-semicontinuity, Ō_M ⊆ Z_M) ☐ module. L6.4 `vanishingIdeal(Z_M)=vanishingIdeal(O_M)`\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/findings.md:28:  ideal-level ☐ module (reuses `vanishingIdeal_range_orbitMap_eq_ker`). L1 `(vanishingIdeal Z_M).IsPrime` ☐ short.\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/21-route-sizing/codex/route-sizing-answer.md:3:1