dical\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/17-chart-design/codex/l3-route-answer.md:75:If starting from tangent instead, use `LinearEquiv.dualMap` and possibly `Module.evalEquiv` for finite-dimensional reflexive vector spaces. The explicit chart makes this close to automatic once coordinate differentials are matched to the image of `dμ_M = δ⁰`; a determinantal-Jacobian route would require a heavier conormal/Jacobian-rank development.\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/41-fidelity-audit/codex/voigt-fidelity-prompt.md:11:- The orbit closure Ō_M equals the determinantal RANK LOCUS {A | rank(A_{i..j}) ≤ rank(M_{i..j}) ∀ i≤j}\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/41-fidelity-audit/codex/voigt-fidelity-prompt.md:19:1. codimRep(coord, Z) := Ideal.height (vanishingIdeal (coord '' Z)) in MvPolynomial(RepCoord d) k.\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/41-fidelity-audit/codex/voigt-fidelity-prompt.md:23:   varietyDim Z := (ringKrullDim (MvPolynomial(RepCoord d) k ⧸ vanishingIdeal (coord '' Z))).unbotD 0.\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/41-fidelity-audit/codex/voigt-fidelity-prompt.md:31:   - L0 bridge (Nullstellensatz + catenary): for prime vanishingIdeal,\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/41-fidelity-audit/codex/voigt-fidelity-prompt.md:37:           trace-adjoint deltaT, rank(deltaT)=rank(δ⁰)]; trdeg(orbit image) ≤ genericDifferentialRank\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/41-fidelity-audit/codex/voigt-fidelity-prompt.md:38:           ≤ finrank(range δ⁰); varietyDim Z_M = ringKrullDim(orbit coordinate ring) [needs Z_M = Ō_M].\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/41-fidelity-audit/codex/voigt-fidelity-prompt.md:53:Q1 (codimRep fidelity). Is Ideal.height(vanishingIdeal(canonicalCoord '' Z)) the correct encoding of\n./expeditions/2026-06-18-voigt-discharge/threads/41-fidelity-audit/codex/voigt-fidelity-prompt.md:64:   one side definitionally the other (circular)? 